      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2017 Elsevier B.V. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "In this paper the third-rank chromatic aberration coefficients of round electron lenses are analytically derived and numerically calculated by Mathematica. Furthermore, the numerical results are cross-checked by the differential algebraic (DA) method, which verifies that all the formulas for the third-rank chromatic aberration coefficients are completely correct. It is hoped that this work would be helpful for further chromatic aberration correction in electron microscopy."
      },
